  "title": "Corrective fix for B-40c6c189: Shared review for AddItemSheet aisle picker persistence fix",
  "agent_type": "developer",
  "description": "Blocked reason: setAisleProgrammatically does not guard against same-value writes. When selectedAisle already holds the target value, onChange(of: selectedAisle) does not fire, leaving isProgrammaticAisleUpdate=true permanently. The next genuine user picker tap clears the flag but skips isAisleManuallySelected=true, allowing auto-detect to override the user's choice on the next keystroke. Fix: add `guard selectedAisle != aisle else { return }` as the first line of setAisleProgrammatically.\n\nRemaining work: Fix setAisleProgrammatically to guard against same-value writes (guard selectedAisle != aisle else { return }). Add a test exercising the sticky-flag path. Re-run tester to confirm no regressions.",
